flowchart LR
  Prompt --> PromptHash[SHA-256]
  PromptHash --> Session
  Session --> Event[JSON event]
  Event --> EventHash[SHA-256 chain record]
  Workspace --> Diff[Changed-file set]
  Diff --> Test[Test output + exit code]
  Test --> StateHash[Final state hash]
  EventHash --> Manifest[Run manifest]
  StateHash --> Manifest
